{"seq":2,"slug":"emission-factor-transport-mode-chain","title":"排放因子与多式联运分段核算链：运输模式碳强度的工程口径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/carbon-neutral-green-shipping-estimation-options/carbon-accounting-methodology/emission-factor-transport-mode-chain","wordCount":3036,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"排放因子与多式联运分段核算链-运输模式碳强度的工程口径\">排放因子与多式联运分段核算链：运输模式碳强度的工程口径</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一张跨境电商运单的碳强度，由<strong>运输活动量</strong>（activity data，走了多少吨公里或烧了多少升燃料）与<strong>排放因子</strong>（emission factor，每单位活动量对应的温室气体量）相乘得到。分段核算链（segmented accounting chain）要解决的工程问题，是把含揽收、干线、换装、末端四类节点的多式联运运单，<strong>拆成可加和、可归因、可核验的链段</strong>，每段乘以对应模式的因子再累加。</p>\n<p>这条链的行业基准是 <strong>ISO 14083:2023</strong>《Greenhouse gases — Quantification and reporting of greenhouse gas emissions arising from transport chain operations》，2023 年 3 月 20 日发布第一版（iso.org），同时覆盖货运与客运，也是 GLEC Framework 第 3 版（Smart Freight Centre）采纳的分段口径。到 2026 年，<strong>ISO 14083 + GLEC v3 已是事实上的合规基线</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  O[订单运单] --&gt; L1[第一链段&lt;br/&gt;揽收上门 柴油卡车]&#10;  L1 --&gt; H1[换装节点&lt;br/&gt;机场/铁路场站]&#10;  H1 --&gt; L2[干线段&lt;br/&gt;空运 或 铁路 或 海运]&#10;  L2 --&gt; H2[目的口岸换装]&#10;  H2 --&gt; L3[末端链段&lt;br/&gt;区域电网供电 电动货车]&#10;  L3 --&gt; D[交付收货人]&#10;  L1 -. 活动量 x 因子 .-&gt; E[碳强度累加]&#10;  L2 -. 活动量 x 因子 .-&gt; E&#10;  L3 -. 活动量 x 因子 .-&gt; E\">graph TD\n  O[订单运单] --&gt; L1[第一链段&lt;br/&gt;揽收上门 柴油卡车]\n  L1 --&gt; H1[换装节点&lt;br/&gt;机场/铁路场站]\n  H1 --&gt; L2[干线段&lt;br/&gt;空运 或 铁路 或 海运]\n  L2 --&gt; H2[目的口岸换装]\n  H2 --&gt; L3[末端链段&lt;br/&gt;区域电网供电 电动货车]\n  L3 --&gt; D[交付收货人]\n  L1 -. 活动量 x 因子 .-&gt; E[碳强度累加]\n  L2 -. 活动量 x 因子 .-&gt; E\n  L3 -. 活动量 x 因子 .-&gt; E</pre><p>这一区间是结构性的，不随时效偏好改变。按英国政府 2025 年发布的《温室气体报告用转换因子》（UK Government GHG Conversion Factors for Company Reporting，DESNZ 于 2025 年 6 月 10 日发布），货运每吨公里碳强度大致落在下列区间；具体取值以平台选定的因子工作表为准，不同口径（是否含上游）不可混用：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>运输模式</th>\n<th>每吨公里碳强度量级（kgCO₂e/t·km）</th>\n<th>因子离散度</th>\n<th>活动量可得性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>航空货运</td>\n<td>0.6 – 1.0</td>\n<td>高（机型、载货率、航段）</td>\n<td>中（需向货代索取）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重型柴油货车（HGV）</td>\n<td>约 0.1</td>\n<td>中（车重、装载率、路况）</td>\n<td>高（承运方月结账单）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>铁路货运</td>\n<td>0.02 – 0.03</td>\n<td>低（电气化率主导）</td>\n<td>中（铁路运营方）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集装箱海运</td>\n<td>0.01 – 0.02</td>\n<td>中（船型、航速、航线）</td>\n<td>中（船公司/联盟）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>因子与活动量的组合有两种：<strong>活动量法</strong>用「距离 × 载重 × 每吨公里因子」，适合承运方工具链成熟、有分段路由数据的场景；<strong>能耗法</strong>用「实际燃料消耗 × 燃料因子」，精度最高但需承运方提供燃料账单。前者可订单级实时算，后者只能事后核验，且必须在同一份报告里<strong>标注所用方法</strong>，否则数字不可比。</p>\n<h2 id=\"排放因子的三种口径-ttw-wtt-与-wtw\">排放因子的三种口径：TTW、WTT 与 WTW</h2><p>排放因子最容易出事的地方不是数值大小，而是<strong>边界口径</strong>。同一段运输，报「尾气直排」还是报「含燃料上游」，结果可以差 20%–40%，而两种口径在合同与标签里都常被简写成「碳排放」。三个口径：<strong>TtW</strong>（Tank-to-Wheel/Wake，只算实际燃烧排放，即尾气）、<strong>WtT</strong>（Well-to-Tank，燃料开采到加注的上游排放）、<strong>WtW</strong>（Well-to-Wheel/Wake，二者之和的完整生命周期口径），关系即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>W</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>W</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{WtW} = f_{TtW} + f_{WtT}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">tT</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。工程上这件事在 2025 年后变成硬约束：欧盟 <strong>FuelEU Maritime（Regulation (EU) 2023/1805）</strong> 自 2025 年 1 月 1 日起全面适用，对 5000 总吨以上船舶按 <strong>WtW 全生命周期口径</strong>限制温室气体强度，覆盖 CO₂、甲烷与氧化亚氮。这意味着海运承运方给到的合规因子天然是 WtW 口径，而许多陆运工具默认给 TTW，两者直接相加就是界面错配。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>口径</th>\n<th>边界</th>\n<th>典型使用场景</th>\n<th>易犯错误</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TtW / TTW</td>\n<td>仅燃烧尾气</td>\n<td>承运方月度运营报表、车队管理</td>\n<td>与 WtW 因子混加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WtT</td>\n<td>燃料上游</td>\n<td>上游排放单独披露、燃料切换对比</td>\n<td>重复计入已含在上游的电耗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WtW</td>\n<td>全生命周期</td>\n<td>FuelEU Maritime、ISO 14083 报告、碳标签</td>\n<td>与小口径因子直接求和</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对中国电网供电的铁路与末端电动化，上游口径处理与化石燃料不同：电力没有 WtT 燃料链，其「上游」体现为<strong>发电与输配电的电网碳强度因子</strong>，因此电网因子本身就是全生命周期电力因子，不应再叠加一次燃料上游。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分段核算链的构建-从运单到可加和的链段\">分段核算链的构建：从运单到可加和的链段</h2><p>ISO 14083 的核心操作是把运输链切分为<strong>运输作业类别</strong>（transport operation category），每段以「起点 – 终点 – 模式 – 载运工具类型」为键。切分粒度直接决定核算成败：切太粗会把高碳干线淹没在总里程里，切太细会引入大量无因子可用的空节点。</p>\n<p>链段碳强度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{chain} = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} m_i \\cdot d_i \\cdot f_i \\cdot c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hain</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.104em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为该段计费载重（吨），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为距离（公里），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为该模式每吨公里因子，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为无量纲修正系数（装载率、空驶、换装的综合折减，见下节）。载重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 需使用<strong>计费重量口径</strong>，即实际毛重与体积重量（volumetric weight）的较大者；航空与陆运的体积换算系数可能不同，若直接用商品净重代入，会系统性低估干线排放。</p>\n<p>一个可复核的算例：12 吨货物从上海到法兰克福，干线约 9,000 公里。走空运取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{air}=0.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span></span></span></span></span> kgCO₂e/t·km，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>9000</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>86.4</mn><mtext> </mtext><msub><mtext>tCO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>e</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{air} = 12 \\times 9000 \\times 0.8 = 86.4\\ \\text{tCO}_2\\text{e}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">86.4</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tCO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">e</span></span></span></span></span></span>；改走中欧铁路取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.03</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{rail}=0.03</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.03</span></span></span></span></span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3.24</mn><mtext> </mtext><msub><mtext>tCO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>e</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{rail} = 3.24\\ \\text{tCO}_2\\text{e}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.24</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tCO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">e</span></span></span></span></span></span>。两段口径必须一致（同取 WtW 或同取 TtW），否则这个近 27 倍的差值不可信——「同口径相减」正是模式转换类绿色选项的减碳量来源。</p>\n<p>链段不是越细越好：<strong>换装节点本身也消耗能源</strong>（起重机械、场站照明、冷藏插座），ISO 14083 允许在节点排放不显著时并入相邻链段或单列，工程上应固化一条「节点是否单列」的规则并全局一致。对跨境订单还有一个常被忽略的修正：干线由船公司承运、支线由货代转包时，若平台同时采信各方报告，可能把同一次运输计入两次；ISO 14083 用「运输链运营者」概念界定归因主体，数据模型必须固化「每链段有唯一归因方」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多式联运的空驶-装载率与换装修正\">多式联运的空驶、装载率与换装修正</h2><p>上一节的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是分段链最容易失真的一环，它把「名义因子」拉回「本次实际因子」。三个修正量级最大。</p>\n<p><strong>装载率修正。</strong> 每吨公里因子通常按名义满载标定，而实际平均装载率常低于满载。若名义因子为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>、实载系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span>（实际载重 / 额定载重），摊到本次货物上的有效因子约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f/u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span>。装载率越低，单位吨公里碳强度越高——这就是路由整合（consolidation）类选项的物理依据。</p>\n<p><strong>空驶修正。</strong> 回程空放时其燃料不产生周转量，但排放客观存在，ISO 14083 要求用空驶率把回程排放摊回载货段：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mi>u</mi></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{eff} = \\frac{f_{nominal}}{u} \\times \\frac{1}{1 - r_{empty}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2772em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9322em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mina</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3874em;vertical-align:-0.5423em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5423em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。若为改走铁路而安排空放车皮，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{empty}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 上升会让整链碳强度不降反升——模式转换选项必须携带「最小装载率假设」，否则减碳承诺落空。</p>\n<p><strong>换装修正。</strong> 每次换装多一次节点能耗与等待排放，但换来干线段的模式跃迁，净效应通常为正；换装能耗应作为独立链段单列，避免被干线段的低因子「稀释」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"因子来源与数据质量分级\">因子来源与数据质量分级</h2><p>因子从哪来，决定了这份碳强度是「可用」还是「漂绿」。业界把因子按<strong>来源权威度与特异性</strong>分级，报告必须标注所用层级：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>因子来源</th>\n<th>特异性</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一级</td>\n<td>承运方实测燃料/能耗数据 × 燃料因子</td>\n<td>最高，承运方+线路级</td>\n<td>事后核验、合规报告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二级</td>\n<td>承运方或联盟发布的特定因子</td>\n<td>高，承运方级</td>\n<td>承运方选择、合同披露</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三级</td>\n<td>GLEC / ISO 14083 默认因子（按模式与地区）</td>\n<td>中，模式级</td>\n<td>结账页实时估算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>四级</td>\n<td>支出法（每元运费反推排放）</td>\n<td>低，仅经济近似</td>\n<td>兜底、无运输数据时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>海运领域常用 <strong>Clean Cargo（Smart Freight Centre）</strong> 的贸易航线因子作为二级来源，按船公司与航线给出比通用模式因子更细的取值。跨模式计算工具方面，<strong>EcoTransIT World</strong> 采用基于能耗的自底向上方法（ifeu、INFRAS、Fraunhofer IML 维护），声明通过 <strong>ISO 14083 与 GLEC Framework 认证</strong>并符合 GHG Protocol 企业标准。关键约束是<strong>同一份报告不得跨层级混用而不标注</strong>：用三级默认因子算结账页估算、用一级实测数据做事后核验是合理的两阶段模型，但把两者写成同一数字对外披露，就是把估计值伪装成实测值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"监管口径对齐-iso-14083-fueleu-与-eu-ets\">监管口径对齐：ISO 14083、FuelEU 与 EU ETS</h2><p>2026 年因子口径已被监管倒逼收敛到少数几套，平台需把内部因子表映射到外部口径并保留映射表以便审计。<strong>ISO 14083 / GLEC v3</strong> 是方法学基线。<strong>FuelEU Maritime</strong> 从 2025 年起按 WtW 口径对 5000 GT 以上船舶设定碳强度上限并逐年收紧（2025 年较 2020 基准降 2%，2030 年 6%，2035 年 14.5%，2040 年 31%，2050 年 80%），首个核验报告需在 2026 年 1 月 31 日前提交核验机构，把海运段因子锚定在 WtW。</p>\n<p><strong>EU ETS 航运纳入</strong> 从 2024 年 1 月起覆盖 5000 GT 以上船舶：2024 年排放清缴 40%（2025 年截止）、2025 年 70%（2026 年截止）、2026 年 100%（2027 年及以后）；欧盟内航次与港内停泊排放 100% 覆盖，进出欧盟的境外航次按 50% 覆盖，自 2026 年起甲烷与氧化亚氮一并纳入（climate.ec.europa.eu）。同一段海运若涉及欧盟港口，其承担份额随航次类型不同，因子必须叠加「航次类型」维度。</p>\n<p><strong>IMO 层面</strong> 的 2023 年温室气体战略设定 2030 年较 2008 年减排至少 20%、2040 年至少 70% 的目标；EEXI 与年度 CII（A–E 分级）自 2023 年 1 月起强制。IMO 净零框架本拟以 MARPOL 附件六修正案在 2025 年 10 月特别会议通过，但会议休会一年，谈判预计 2026 年 10 月重启（imo.org）。因此 <strong>IMO 侧因子口径仍在演进，平台应保留可热更新的因子版本机制</strong>，不宜把未定稿数值固化进生产因子表。</p>\n<p>在标签与声明层面，欧盟《绿色声明指令》（Directive (EU) 2023/2673）禁止仅靠碳抵消宣称产品或配送「碳中和」，并要求成员国在 2026 年 9 月 27 日前完成转化，故<strong>减排量与抵消量必须分层披露，不得合并成一个「已碳中和」的因子值</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>分段核算链 = 活动量 × 排放因子</strong>，逐段累加；ISO 14083:2023 与 GLEC Framework v3 是 2026 年的方法学基线，链段以「起终点 + 模式 + 载运工具类型」为键切分。</li>\n<li><strong>口径必须统一</strong>：TtW（尾气）、WtT（燃料上游）、WtW（全生命周期）三者不可混加；FuelEU Maritime 已把海运因子锚定在 WtW 口径。</li>\n<li><strong>分段数不等于精度</strong>：干线、支线、末端与换装节点应分层可见，避免高碳干线被低因子段稀释；节点是否单列需全局一致。</li>\n<li><strong>有效因子需三重修正</strong>：装载率（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f/u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span>）、空驶率（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/(1-r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）与换装能耗；模式转换选项必须携带最小装载率与空驶假设。</li>\n<li><strong>因子按数据质量分级</strong>（实测 → 承运方特定 → GLEC 默认 → 支出法），报告须标注层级；承诺值与实测值本就该是两套数字。</li>\n<li><strong>监管口径正在收敛</strong>：EU ETS 按航次类型分摊（境外 50%、境内 100%），IMO 净零框架尚未定稿，因子表需保留可热更新的版本机制。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本章产出可直接被下游消费：<a href=\"../green-shipping-options/green-delivery-option-taxonomy\">绿色配送选项分类与适用边界</a> 用这些碳强度值构造结账页的对比与选项。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"排放因子与多式联运分段核算链：运输模式碳强度的工程口径","id":"排放因子与多式联运分段核算链-运输模式碳强度的工程口径"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"排放因子的三种口径：TTW、WTT 与 WTW","id":"排放因子的三种口径-ttw-wtt-与-wtw"},{"level":2,"text":"分段核算链的构建：从运单到可加和的链段","id":"分段核算链的构建-从运单到可加和的链段"},{"level":2,"text":"多式联运的空驶、装载率与换装修正","id":"多式联运的空驶-装载率与换装修正"},{"level":2,"text":"因子来源与数据质量分级","id":"因子来源与数据质量分级"},{"level":2,"text":"监管口径对齐：ISO 14083、FuelEU 与 EU ETS","id":"监管口径对齐-iso-14083-fueleu-与-eu-ets"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"物流碳排放核算边界与 GLEC 框架模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/carbon-neutral-green-shipping-estimation-options/carbon-accounting-methodology/emission-scope-boundary-glec-model"},"next":{"title":"包裹级碳排计算与不确定度处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/carbon-neutral-green-shipping-estimation-options/carbon-accounting-methodology/parcel-level-calculation-uncertainty"}}